  {
    "RowOffset": 518826,
    "RowId": 2864,
    "Description": "Deploys a single-target battle turret which attacks using <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Volley Fire</span>, dealing damage with a potency of 35.\nPotency increases as <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Battery Gauge</span> exceeds required cost at time of deployment, up to a maximum of 75.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Battery Gauge Cost: </span>50\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>9s\nConsumes <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Battery Gauge</span> upon execution.\nShuts down when time expires or upon execution of <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Rook Overdrive</span>.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Rook Overdrive</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 519418,
    "RowId": 2865,
    "Description": "Deploys an area of effect battle turret which will deliver auto-attacks to enemies within range with a potency of 60 for the first enemy, 10% less for the second, 20% less for the third, 30% less for the fourth, 40% less for the fifth, and 50% less for all remaining enemies.<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Potency:</span> 90\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Effect:</span> Increases target's damage taken by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Rook Autoturret</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 519978,
    "RowId": 2866,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 140.<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> by 5<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 520150,
    "RowId": 2867,
    "Description": "Loads firearm with three rounds of special ammunition. One round of ammunition is used each time a weaponskill is executed, increasing that weaponskill's potency. Ammunition use may also increase the rate at which a weaponskill's additional effect is triggered<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),52))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>, as well as lower the accompanying <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> increase.<Else/>.</If><Else/>.</If> No more than three rounds can be loaded at one time."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 520582,
    "RowId": 2868,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Action: </span><span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Split Shot</span> or <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heated Split Shot</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Potency: </span>210<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Bonus:</span> Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> by 5<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 520918,
    "RowId": 2869,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 40.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Damage over time\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Potency:</span> 45\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> <If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),14))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>30<Else/>18</If><Else/>18</If>s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 521134,
    "RowId": 2870,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 110 to all enemies in a cone before you.<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> by 5<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 521342,
    "RowId": 2871,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 120 to target and all enemies nearby it."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 521430,
    "RowId": 2872,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 240.<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),40))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Battery Gauge</span> by 20<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>\nThis weaponskill does not share a recast timer with any other actions."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 521682,
    "RowId": 2873,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Action: </span><span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Slug Shot</span> or <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heated Slug Shot</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Potency: </span>270<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Bonus: </span>Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> by 5<Else/> </If><Else/> </If><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),40))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Combo Bonus: </span>Increases <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Battery Gauge</span> by 10<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 522134,
    "RowId": 2874,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 130.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Maximum Charges: </span><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),74))>3<Else/>2</If><Else/>2</If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 522254,
    "RowId": 2875,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 240.\nCan only be executed when target's HP is below 20%."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 522362,
    "RowId": 2876,
    "Description": "Guarantees that next weaponskill is a critical direct hit.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 5s\nIncreases damage dealt when under an effect that raises critical hit rate or direct hit rate.\nThis action does not affect damage over time effects.<If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),84))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Maximum Charges: </span>2<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 522698,
    "RowId": 2877,
    "Description": "Afflicts target with <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Heavy</span> +40%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 12s (PvP 8s)<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),22))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Foot Graze</span>.<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 522906,
    "RowId": 2878,
    "Description": "Covers target's body in a slow-burning pitch. Action is changed to <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Detonator</span> for the duration of the effect.\nDeals damage when time expires or upon executing <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Detonator</span>.\nPotency is increased by <If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),78))>240<Else/>100</If><Else/>100</If> for each of your own weaponskills you land prior to the end of the effect.\nCan be stacked up to 6 times.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 523338,
    "RowId": 2879,
    "Description": "Replenishes your ammunition by 1."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 523382,
    "RowId": 2880,
    "Description": "Equips your current firearm with a gauss barrel, increasing damage dealt by 5%. While barrel is equipped, your weapon's <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> will increase each time a weaponskill is executed. When the <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Heat Gauge</span> reaches 100%, your weapon will become <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Overheated</span> and damage dealt will be increased by 20%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s\n<span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Gauss Barrel</span> effect ends automatically once weapon is no longer <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Overheated</span> and cannot be applied again for 10s."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 523962,
    "RowId": 2881,
    "Description": "Reduces weaponskill recast time to 1.5 seconds.\nEffect ends upon executing 3 weaponskills.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 15s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524110,
    "RowId": 2882,
    "Description": "Lowers target's magic damage dealt by 5%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Dismantle</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524270,
    "RowId": 2883,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Stun</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 2s\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Head Graze</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524506,
    "RowId": 2884,
    "Description": "Binds target.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 12s (PvP 8s)\nCancels auto-attack upon execution.\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Leg Graze</span>."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524686,
    "RowId": 2885,
    "Description": "Overcharges your autoturret, increasing its normal attack potency.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 20s\nCan only be executed while a turret is deployed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 524858,
    "RowId": 2886,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Additional Effect:</span> <span style=\"color: #ffff66;\">Silence</span>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 2s<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),45))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>\nShares a recast timer with <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Suppressive Fire</span>.<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525126,
    "RowId": 2887,
    "Description": "Lowers target's damage dealt by 10%.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>10s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525214,
    "RowId": 2888,
    "Description": "Deals a 15-yalm knockback."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525254,
    "RowId": 2889,
    "Description": "Disables a turret's attack mode. Rooks will instead create a 20-yalm radius TP-regeneration field.<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),50))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))> Bishops will create an MP-regeneration field.<Else/> </If><Else/> </If> Caster MP is slowly drained while autoturret is promoted.<If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),30))><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))>\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Effect:</span> Regeneration potency is doubled<Else/> </If><Else/> </If>\nAttack mode is reactivated upon reuse.\nCan only be executed while a turret is deployed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525690,
    "RowId": 2890,
    "Description": "Deals damage to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 130 for the first enemy, and 30% less for all remaining enemies.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Maximum Charges: </span><If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),31))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(72),74))>3<Else/>2</If><Else/>2</If>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 525898,
    "RowId": 2891,
    "Description": "Delivers an attack with a potency of 80.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Potency:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> 120\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Effect:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> Increases target's physical damage taken by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 526146,
    "RowId": 2892,
    "Description": "Deals unaspected damage to all nearby enemies with a potency of 60.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Potency:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> 90\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Hypercharge Effect:<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\"> Increases target's magic damage taken by 5%\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration:</span> 10s"
  },
